    "description": "At Isolina, we pay sincere homage to those recipes lovingly jotted down in a notebook. Here, each dish evokes the generous portions served at home, keeping the tradition of old-fashioned cooking alive. A place to eat, drink, and have a good time. Here we celebrate spontaneous laughter, a lively party, and the freedom to eat however you like. Long live the taverns!",
