    "reviews_summary": "Isolina - Barranco is celebrated by many travelers for its rustic and welcoming tavern atmosphere, offering a casual and local vibe. While the food earns high praise for its authentic Peruvian flavors and generous portions, reviewers note the potential for long wait times, especially without reservations. The value is seen as reasonable given the portion sizes, though some caution about potential food waste. Service is generally praised for being friendly and attentive, despite occasional language barriers."
